      * semaphore word; SET_SEMAPHORE_OFFSET is not added (in X-Men Legends it
      * held 0xFF000000 at times, which put the write outside guest memory). */
+    /* Only forward, and only a little: D3D's fences count up one at a time,
+     * so a real release is always just ahead of the semaphore. A release
+     * decoded from data during a desync carries whatever the data held --
